WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: ar

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Transcriber: Ahmad Hammadi
المدقّق: Mohamed Salem

00:00:10.339 --> 00:00:11.966
I am Hanan Ramsis

00:00:11.966 --> 00:00:16.971
,I am so interested in stock exchange
training and Entrepreneurship

00:00:17.889 --> 00:00:19.015
thank you

00:00:19.098 --> 00:00:23.811
(applause)

00:00:24.187 --> 00:00:29.609
of course, I am so interested in youth
because, as we say, they are the future

00:00:29.609 --> 00:00:33.154
and the next in taking
the responsibility of development

00:00:33.154 --> 00:00:38.826
and in every thing related to
next successes

00:00:39.368 --> 00:00:42.246
I am so interested in Entrepreneurship

00:00:42.246 --> 00:00:46.959
because it is not
a wide prevalent idea in Egypt

00:00:46.959 --> 00:00:50.463
at contrast of the Arab world
because we have a problem

00:00:50.463 --> 00:00:54.342
which is that we have
low financial abilities

00:00:54.467 --> 00:00:56.844
but we have high ambitions

00:00:57.553 --> 00:01:00.098
I am so interested in
changing youth’s way of thinking

00:01:00.098 --> 00:01:02.934
and making them
invest all of their abilities

00:01:02.934 --> 00:01:07.355
using their talents and personal vision

00:01:07.355 --> 00:01:10.316
,so with a few resources
every one can be an Entrepreneur

00:01:10.316 --> 00:01:15.822
Entrepreneur is a person who can manage
a project no matter what the resources are

00:01:15.822 --> 00:01:18.199
and be a profit project

00:01:18.199 --> 00:01:21.077
and the person take the responsibility
of this project

00:01:22.161 --> 00:01:24.122
of course, there are a lot of people

00:01:24.122 --> 00:01:30.545
interested in training on what they work
when they enter the labour market

00:01:31.087 --> 00:01:35.091
there are a lot of people
who wanted to start their own projects

00:01:35.091 --> 00:01:39.554
some people wants to work at banks
and governmental institutions

00:01:39.595 --> 00:01:41.139
but we want to develop the idea

00:01:41.139 --> 00:01:46.519
because we discovered that the whole world
depends on developing small projects

00:01:46.519 --> 00:01:50.690
and increasing the ability
of country to compete

00:01:50.690 --> 00:01:52.275
and increasing its resources

00:01:52.275 --> 00:01:55.403
so we are very interested in
the Entrepreneurship of youth

00:01:55.403 --> 00:02:00.324
every one can invest
in stock exchange to be an Entrepreneur

00:02:00.324 --> 00:02:05.413
they can be a dealer in stock market
and deal in a limited amount of money

00:02:05.413 --> 00:02:07.165
and understand the way of trading

00:02:07.165 --> 00:02:12.837
because trading is a strategy
depends on studying not luck

00:02:12.920 --> 00:02:18.926
,after starting trading, success
and making a good amount of money

00:02:18.926 --> 00:02:24.182
I can begin my own project in cooperation
with friends who are the same of me

00:02:24.182 --> 00:02:27.351
and have the same wish of success

00:02:27.351 --> 00:02:30.646
so we register our project
in stock exchange

00:02:30.646 --> 00:02:34.483
through Nile stock exchange
for small and medium projects

00:02:34.483 --> 00:02:40.406
this may qualifies me to share 
my successful experience with others

00:02:40.406 --> 00:02:43.618
to enable them follow the same steps

00:02:43.618 --> 00:02:48.706
I am also interested in
enhancing youth’s edification

00:02:48.706 --> 00:02:52.084
to make them start writing
their economic ideas

00:02:52.084 --> 00:02:56.005
which they learned and studied
in university, for example

00:02:56.005 --> 00:02:57.590
post them on websites

00:02:57.590 --> 00:03:01.219
and give youth the chance
to contribute with us by their opinion

00:03:01.219 --> 00:03:04.639
in country’s knotty economic issues

00:03:04.639 --> 00:03:06.057
we must give them a chance

00:03:06.057 --> 00:03:11.020
when youth has their own channel
in which they can achieve their ambition

00:03:11.020 --> 00:03:15.733
then they will have the ability
to continue and create

00:03:15.733 --> 00:03:20.655
and has the ability to study hard
and define their country’s problems

00:03:20.655 --> 00:03:22.698
find the best solution for them

00:03:22.698 --> 00:03:28.371
,we can, as a government
invest the youth who has new ideas

00:03:28.371 --> 00:03:32.833
to solve intractable problems
whom we could not solve in the past

00:03:32.833 --> 00:03:33.834
beside that

00:03:33.834 --> 00:03:40.549
we can encourage them, if they have
,a good knowledge about trading

00:03:40.549 --> 00:03:45.221
create a channel on YouTube to explain
the way of trading for starters

00:03:45.221 --> 00:03:49.141
for example, how they can
create an individual project

00:03:49.141 --> 00:03:51.435
all of these are common ideas between us

00:03:51.435 --> 00:03:57.817
but every one of us needs to know 
the best way to achieve his/her ambitions

00:03:57.817 --> 00:04:01.821
of course, when government nears distances
between education and labour market

00:04:01.821 --> 00:04:04.699
this is what we interested in
at the current period

00:04:04.699 --> 00:04:08.744
we will see at the next period
a lot of people who have good ideas

00:04:08.744 --> 00:04:12.623
that can save the government
from successive economic crises

00:04:12.665 --> 00:04:13.666
that’s it

00:04:13.791 --> 00:04:19.964
(applause)

00:04:20.047 --> 00:04:21.215
thank you

